%c╔═%c Debug %c═══════════════╗%c
%c║%c You can access the debug mode by adding #debug at the end of the URL and reloading.
%c║%c Press [V] to toggle the free camera.
%c╚═══════════════════════╝%c

%c╔═%c Three.js %c════════════╗%c
%c║%c Three.js is the library I’m using to render this 3D world (release: 183)
%c║%c https://threejs.org/
%c║%c It was created by mr.doob (https://x.com/mrdoob, https://github.com/mrdoob),
%c║%c followed by hundreds of awesome developers,
%c║%c one of which being Sunag (https://x.com/sea3dformat, https://github.com/sunag) who added TSL,
%c║%c enabling the use of both WebGL and WebGPU, making this portfolio possible.
%c╚═══════════════════════╝%c

%c╔═%c Three.js Journey %c════╗%c
%c║%c If you want to learn Three.js, I got you covered with this huge course.
%c║%c https://threejs-journey.com/
%c║%c It contains everything you need to start building awesome stuff with Three.js (and much more).
%c╚═══════════════════════╝%c

